d vernon is equally  incensed by the magical world  with the two of them swearing that  they'll never let harry be a wizard  until hogwarts eventually intervenes  you're a wizard harry even with the  specter of magic  hanging over them it's still a bit  baffling that vernon and petunia would  be  so angry and resentful to a small child  rowling eventually revealed that issues  between the dursleys and harry's parents  went all the way back to a double date  gone wrong  during which james antagonized dursleys  to the point of no return  as he grows up harry's growing  resemblance to his father  infuriates the dursleys and uncle vernon  in particular  one of the strangest figures that lives  within hogwarts walls has got to be  moaning myrtle the ghost of a young girl  killed by the basilisk that resides  inside the chamber of secrets  clearly myrtle has had some trouble  letting go since she haunts the very  bathroom where she died  and she spends her time wreaking havoc  haunting students and generally being  kind of annoying  thanks to this myrtle is generally  considered one of the school's least  liked ghosts  at one point rowling decided to reveal  myrtle's full name  which was previously unknown to readers  taking to twitter the author announced  that myrtle's name is  actually myrtle elizabeth warren though  she was quick to disavow any relation  between hogwarts weirdest ghost  and the accomplished american senator  while the books were still being written  die hard fans engaged in constant  arguments about hermione's love life  hotly debating whether she should end up  with harry or ron  by the time the later books in the  series came around however it had become  relatively clear in which direction  rowling was leaning  mine has got nice skin wouldn't you say  as skin goes i mean  i've never really thought about it but i  suppose yeah i think i'll be going to  sleep now  right in the end she paired hermione  with ron  capitalizing on their years of tension  and many differences  harry meanwhile ended up with jenny  ron's feisty and talented younger sister  however rolling ascents changed course  saying she wished hermione had ended up  with harry after all  she claimed that the relationship  between ron and hermione was simply a  form of wish fulfillment for her  vindicating some fans while infuriating  others  for fans who love the fiery intense  relationship between ron and hermione  however  this felt like a total betrayal by  rowling to date this  incident is counted as one of the most  famous examples of rowling making an  unnecessary reveal  one that many fans wish she had kept to  herself check out one of our newest  videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you

