multiple houses  causes the sorting hat to get stuck on  where to place them  sometimes for more than five minutes  even though the hat struggled with harry  harry isn't considered a hat stall  hermione nearly was  as the hat struggled to choose between  gryffindor and ravenclaw  his classmate neville longbottom's long  sorting process meanwhile  came down to a fight between neville and  the hat over whether or not he was brave  enough for gryffindor  spoiler alert he was as it turns out  however harry actually did  know two hat styles his transfiguration  professor minerva mcgonagall  and his parents own personal judas peter  pettigrew  both ended up in gryffindor after nearly  ending up in ravenclaw and slytherin  respectively fans have asked plenty of  questions about hogwarts itself over the  years but one particular issue seems to  have weighed heavy on their minds  what do students actually do before they  enroll at the school  since students don't start hogwarts  until they hit 11 years of age  many fans wondered what young magical  children did before their seven-year  schooling career began  in an interview with time after the book  series came to a close  rowling answered several remaining  questions about the books  and one revelation cleared up this exact  question during the interview  rowling confirmed that young wizarding  children are homeschooled  since many younger witches and wizards  have trouble controlling their magic  and must be kept at home so they don't  reveal themselves to muggles by mistake  before harry learns that he's a wizard  and starts attending hogwarts he spends  11 miserable years  living with his aunt petunia and uncle  vernon as well as their son dudley  the dursleys all despise harry and treat  him terribly  even forcing the orphan to sleep in a  spider-ridden cupboard under the stairs  it's later revealed that petunia was  jealous of her sister's magical ability  despite frequently calling lily a freak  her detestable husband vernon is equally  incensed by the magical world  with the two of them swearing that  they'll never let harry be a wizard  until hogwarts eventually intervenes  you're a wizard harry even with the  specter of magic  hanging over them it's still a bit  baffling that vernon and petunia would  be  so angry and resentful to a small child  rowling eventually revealed that issues  between the dursleys and harry's parents  went all the way back to a double date  gone wrong  during which james antagonized dursleys  to the point of no return  as he grows up harry's growing  resemblance to his father  infuriates the dursleys and uncle vernon  in particular  one of the strangest figures that lives  within hogwarts walls has got to be  moaning myrtle the ghost of a young girl  killed by the basilisk that resides  inside the chamber of secrets  clearly myrtle has had some trouble  letting go since she haunts the very  bathroom where she died  and she spends her time wreaking havoc  haunting students and generally being  kind of annoying  thanks to this myrtle is generally  considered one of the school's least  liked ghosts  at one point rowling decided to reveal  myrtle's full name  which was previously unknown to readers  taking to twitter the author announced  that myrtle's name is  actually myrtle elizabeth warren though  she was quick to disavow any relation  between hogwarts weirdest ghost  and the accomplished american senator  while the books were still being written  die hard fans engaged in constant  arguments about hermione's love life  hotly debating whether she should end up  with harry or ron  by the time the later books in the  series came around however it had become  relatively clear in which direction  rowling was leaning  mine has got nice skin wouldn't you say  as skin goes i mean  i've never really thought about it but i  suppose yeah i think i'll be going to  sleep now  right in the end she paired hermione  with ron  capitalizing on their years of tension  and many differences  harry meanwhile ended up with jenny  ron's feisty and talented younger sister  however rolling ascents changed course  saying she wished hermione had ended up  with harry after all  she claimed that the relationship  between ron and hermione was simply a  form of wish fulfillment for her  vindicating some fans while infuriating  others  for fans who love the fiery intense  relationship between ron and hermione  however  this felt like a total betrayal by  rowling to date this  incident is counted as one of the most  famous examples of rowling making an  unnecessary reveal  one that many fans wish she had kept to  herself check out one of our newest  videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you


